{"version":1,"content":"<p>樂壇天后鄧紫棋（G.E.M.）相隔14年再次為香港賽馬會登台，將於12月13日現身沙田馬場，為年度世界級賽馬盛事「浪琴香港國際賽事」擔任表演嘉賓，以震撼歌聲為這場國際體壇盛典掀開序幕。</p><p>這是她繼2012年在跑馬地馬場表演後，首次在沙田馬場演出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:17:36.839763+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:10:41.316790+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:10:41.316790+00:00","content_hash":"cb76fb726b9c66b864d93c3d50c79a0c6d689b3a86295ea285fe788aec343f1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}